  "prefLabel": "Plu 301.04 Water supply system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 301.04 “Water supply system” means the water service pipe, water distribution pipes, and the necessary connecting pipes, fittings, control valves and all appurtenances in or adjacent to the structure or premises.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Plu 301) #8981, eff 9-20-07",
